@startuml US_3_2_4_C3_Impl
title US 3.2.4 - Implementação RBAC

component Routes as "app.routes.ts\ndata.roles"
component Guard as "AuthGuard"
component AuthSvc as "AuthService\nroles cache"
component Middleware as "NetworkRestrictionMiddleware\n/ api"
component Controllers as "Controllers\n[Authorize]"
database DB as "PortContext"

Routes --> Guard
Guard --> AuthSvc : role check
Controllers --> Middleware : pipeline
Middleware --> DB : validar AppUser ativo + roles
Controllers --> DB : domain ops (após authz)

@enduml
